		IF ARG:1
			;If the player and character are on a date
			;デート中に眠くて帰って寝る（拠点キャラのみ）
			PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"Ugh... Sorry, I'm having a good time, but I just can't stay awake...:I seriously need to rest up for a work project, so I'll be going back! Sorry!")%」
